[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3474720060","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112258#issuecomment-3474720060","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112258","id":3474720060,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PHAU8","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-31T20:05:46Z","updated_at":"2025-10-31T20:05:46Z","body":"This needs specifics to be actionable, as in which UI elements need the contrast increase. If you compare the new theme with the old one you'll see that some elements have less contrast while some other elements have more contrast. Some things that currently lack contrast are known bugs that will be fixed in follow-up PRs, i.e I just [opened a PR to fix one of them](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112260), but there are few other left to go. Make sure to test the master branch because the contrast has already been increased since the PR was initially opened, so a lot of screenshots from the theme PR are now outdated.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3474720060/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3474826475","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112258#issuecomment-3474826475","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112258","id":3474826475,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PHaTr","user":{"login":"Fireye04","id":45439844,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDM5ODQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45439844?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04","html_url":"https://github.com/Fireye04","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-31T20:41:57Z","updated_at":"2025-10-31T20:41:57Z","body":"This is from a master branch build I did this morning from 250ef8d \n\nThis is specifically about discerning foreground from background, as the two primary colors have been made significantly more similar, and I'm having trouble discerning where certain UI elements begin and end: \n\n<img width=\"372\" height=\"107\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ff8407eb-3703-41d4-a548-bd9520078975\" />\n\n<img width=\"372\" height=\"107\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8903082e-1adb-4af9-9731-b725eaf66370\" />\n\n<img width=\"503\" height=\"85\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f098f715-0721-40e6-b1d4-bb9b55b49727\" />\n\n<img width=\"503\" height=\"85\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d56c4b9f-48d7-48bf-a01c-d4b8daa60e47\" />\n\n<br><br>\n\nThe new button style is great for this though:\n\n<img width=\"276\" height=\"186\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/faea5be3-e2ef-4678-bd2b-0c3036c56b71\" />\n\n<img width=\"276\" height=\"186\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3811dbfa-7650-40bd-b80f-630a4c79e4a5\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3474826475/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3474874108","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112258#issuecomment-3474874108","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112258","id":3474874108,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PHl78","user":{"login":"Giganzo","id":158825920,"node_id":"U_kgDOCXd9wA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158825920?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo","html_url":"https://github.com/Giganzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-31T20:54:41Z","updated_at":"2025-10-31T21:30:57Z","body":"Are we aiming to meet any type of standard, like https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/non-text-contrast.html?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3474874108/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3475054315","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112258#issuecomment-3475054315","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112258","id":3475054315,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PIR7r","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-31T22:16:13Z","updated_at":"2025-10-31T22:16:13Z","body":"@Fireye04 Thanks for the clarification. It's possible that the main UI surface color could be brighter, will need some tests\n\n> Are we aiming to meet any type of standard, like https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/non-text-contrast.html?\n\nWe could. There are a couple of things to keep in mind though:\n\n1. Solutions to a lot of godot's contrast problems (in both themes, because there are some elements that are hard to discern in the classic one too) may need more code than one may expect because a lot of elements in the engine are sharing colors while being drawn on different backgrounds, which means more type variations or hardcoded values will need to be added if you want to be strict with contrast ratios. I'm all for it, but all of the problems probably won't be solved in a day\n\n2. We'll need to evaluate to what extent a web standard like that is applicable to a desktop application like a game engine. It may or may not be worth following very strictly depending on their differences and on what a user expects from a desktop app UI. It makes sense to always use judgement and evaluate what fits a particular situation, but overall I love standards","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3475054315/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3477637754","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112258#issuecomment-3477637754","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112258","id":3477637754,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PSIp6","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url"